{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\n\nMUSIC PLAY \u0022Sound/xmasmix.mod\u0022\n\nFONT LOAD 0, \u0022Graphics/font.png\u0022, 32, 25\nFONT MAP 0, \u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00A3$%.\u2019[]\u201D,-\u0022\n\nSCREEN SELECT 2\nLOAD \u0022Graphics/Layer/FlowerMaskWhite.png\u0022\n\nFONT ZOOM 0, 200,200\nFONT PRINT 0,150,160,\u0022MERRY\u0022\nFONT PRINT 0,30,220,\u0022CHRISTMAS\u0022\n\nPARTICLE 1,20\nY=0\nMain:\n  RASTER 21, 0, 1, 0 \n  RASTER 1,0,0,480, \u0022Green, #99FF99\u0022\n\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO Main","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}